From 3f063d3c375d146d8992bfca9d60752f9260795a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:20:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] lib/sgxfive: add the sgxfive render engine

Add libsgxfive's render builders and engine to lib/sgxfive: the first
triangle's scene (our own assembled vertex, state and pixel programs, the
MTE state, the VDM stream and the geometry) built at the GPU addresses of a
client VM for any render target the kernel accepts, the register words of
a render job, a CPU reference and a pixel checker, and an engine that maps
the scene and a colour buffer in a VM and submits it on a render context.
Update the uapi header for render contexts and jobs.

The transfer engine now keeps PDS_EXEC_BASE at the PDS_PIXEL heap base,
which the kernel requires so that render jobs can rely on it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
